> Once you've met someone, you never really forget them. It just takes a while for your memories to return.

Chihiro never truly grows in the film, as shown by the final scene being an almost shot-for-shot copy of the opening scene in the tunnel, but that's the point. Sometimes to overcome our challenges, we just need to look within. Its not always some extreme external circumstance from which we grow. We don't need always something to drive us. We have it inside of us. Remember your identity. You'll never really forget it.
